26","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom has a basketball. He doesn't have a soccer ball. His sister has a tennis ball. Tom 有足球吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"有"},{"key":"B","text":"有两个"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"没有"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"He doesn't have a soccer ball。","verify":"\"没有\""},{"id":"cne_j026_q2","topicId":"cne_j026","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Tom has a basketball. He doesn't have a soccer ball. His sister has a tennis ball. 谁有网球？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Tom 的姐姐或妹妹"},{"key":"B","text":"Tom"},{"key":"C","text":"Tom 的爸爸"},{"key":"D","text":"Tom 的老师"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"His sister has a tennis ball。","verify":"\"Tom 的姐姐或妹妹\""},{"id":"cne_j026_q3","topicId":"cne_j026","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We have a volleyball. We play it after class. 他们有什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一个篮球"},{"key":"B","text":"一个排球"},{"key":"C","text":"一个足球"},{"key":"D","text":"一个网球"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"a volleyball 是排球。","verify":"\"一个排球\""},{"id":"cne_j026_q4","topicId":"cne_j026","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We have a volleyball. We play it after class. 他们什么时候打？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"早上起床前"},{"key":"B","text":"在家里睡觉时"},{"key":"C","text":"课后"},{"key":"D","text":"只在周末的夜里"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"after class 是课后。","verify":"\"课后\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q1","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「吉他」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"chess"},{"key":"B","text":"guitar"},{"key":"C","text":"club"},{"key":"D","text":"dance"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"guitar 的意思是吉他。","verify":"\"guitar\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q2","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「chess」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"吉他"},{"key":"B","text":"俱乐部"},{"key":"C","text":"国际象棋"},{"key":"D","text":"跳舞"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"chess 的意思是国际象棋。","verify":"\"国际象棋\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q3","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「俱乐部」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"guitar"},{"key":"B","text":"chess"},{"key":"C","text":"dance"},{"key":"D","text":"club"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"表示俱乐部的单词是 club。","verify":"\"club\""},{"id":"cne_j044_q4","topicId":"cne_j044","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「跳舞」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"dance"},{"key":"B","text":"guitar"},{"key":"C","text":"chess"},{"key":"D","text":"club"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"dance 的意思是跳舞。","verify":"\"dance\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q1","topicId":"cne_j045","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"我会弹吉他。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I can to play the guitar."},{"key":"B","text":"I can plays the guitar."},{"key":"C","text":"I can play the guitar."},{"key":"D","text":"I can play guitar the."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"can 后面用动词原形；乐器前通常加 the。","verify":"\"I can play the guitar.\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q2","topicId":"cne_j045","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"她不会下棋。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"She can't plays chess."},{"key":"B","text":"She can not to play chess."},{"key":"C","text":"She doesn't can play chess."},{"key":"D","text":"She can't play chess."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"can't 后面用动词原形 play。","verify":"\"She can't play chess.\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q3","topicId":"cne_j045","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Can you swim? 肯定简答是哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, I can."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, I do."},{"key":"C","text":"Yes, I can swim yes."},{"key":"D","text":"Yes, I am."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"can 提问用 can 回答。","verify":"\"Yes, I can.\""},{"id":"cne_j045_q4","topicId":"cne_j045","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"他会跳舞吗？哪一句是正确的疑问句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Does he can dance?"},{"key":"B","text":"Can he dance?"},{"key":"C","text":"Can he dances?"},{"key":"D","text":"Is he can dance?"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"can 直接提前，后面用原形。","verify":"\"Can he dance?\""},{"id":"cne_j046_q1","topicId":"cne_j046","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方会不会画画，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Do you can draw?"},{"key":"B","text":"Can you draws?"},{"key":"C","text":"Are you can draw?"},{"key":"D","text":"Can you draw?"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Can you draw 询问能力。","verify":"\"Can you draw?\""},{"id":"cne_j046_q2","topicId":"cne_j046","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想加入音乐俱乐部，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I want to join the music club."},{"key":"B","text":"I want join the music club."},{"key":"C","text":"I want to join the music clubbing."},{"key":"D","text":"I wants to join the music club."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"want to join 表示想加入。","verify":"\"I want to join the music club.\""},{"id":"cne_j046_q3","topicId":"cne_j046","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"对方问 Can you play the piano? 你不会，应回答什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"No, I don't."},{"key":"B","text":"No, I can't."},{"key":"C","text":"No, I am not."},{"key":"D","text":"No, I can."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"can 的否定简答是 No, I can't。","verify":"\"No, I can't.\""},{"id":"cne_j046_q4","topicId":"cne_j046","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What club do you want to join? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"你会不会游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"俱乐部在哪里"},{"key":"C","text":"你想加入哪个俱乐部"},{"key":"D","text":"吉他多少钱"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"what club 问哪一个俱乐部。","verify":"\"你想加入哪个俱乐部\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q1","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Music Club. Can you sing or dance? Come and join us. Call Mr. Brown. 这个俱乐部需要什么才能？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"唱歌或跳舞"},{"key":"B","text":"下棋"},{"key":"C","text":"踢足球"},{"key":"D","text":"画画"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"sing or dance 是唱歌或跳舞。","verify":"\"唱歌或跳舞\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q2","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Music Club. Can you sing or dance? Come and join us. Call Mr. Brown. 要联系谁？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Mr. Green"},{"key":"B","text":"Mr. Brown"},{"key":"C","text":"Gina"},{"key":"D","text":"Tom"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Call Mr. Brown。","verify":"\"Mr. Brown\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q3","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We need students for the chess club. Can you play chess? 他们需要会什么的学生？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"会弹吉他"},{"key":"B","text":"会游泳"},{"key":"C","text":"会下国际象棋"},{"key":"D","text":"会说英语"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"play chess 是下棋。","verify":"\"会下国际象棋\""},{"id":"cne_j047_q4","topicId":"cne_j047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We need students for the chess club. Can you play chess? 哪一句和广告一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The club wants singers."},{"key":"B","text":"Students must play the guitar."},{"key":"C","text":"The club is only for teachers."},{"key":"D","text":"The club wants students who can play chess."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"广告要会下棋的学生。","verify":"\"The club wants students who can play chess.\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q1","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"sit down 里，哪一个音常常不完全发出来？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"sit 里的 t"},{"key":"B","text":"down 里的 n"},{"key":"C","text":"sit 里的 s"},{"key":"D","text":"down 里的 d"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"t 后面紧接爆破音 d，t 通常不完全爆破。","verify":"\"sit 里的 t\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q2","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一个短语有不完全爆破？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"my apple"},{"key":"B","text":"good time"},{"key":"C","text":"to a park"},{"key":"D","text":"an old man"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"good 的 d 和 time 的 t 都是爆破音，相邻时前一个不完全爆破。","verify":"\"good time\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q3","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"big kite 里，不完全爆破发生在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"b 和 i 之间"},{"key":"B","text":"k 和 i 之间"},{"key":"C","text":"g 和 k 之间"},{"key":"D","text":"词尾 e 后面"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"big 的 g 和 kite 的 k 是相邻爆破音。","verify":"\"g 和 k 之间\""},{"id":"cne_j107_q4","topicId":"cne_j107","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"不完全爆破通常出现在什么时候？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"元音后面是句号"},{"key":"B","text":"单词只有一个音节"},{"key":"C","text":"句末用升调"},{"key":"D","text":"两个爆破音挨在一起"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"前一个爆破音受后一个爆破音影响，常常听不全。","verify":"\"两个爆破音挨在一起\""}]
